  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A wall of ice (a dome or globe up to 10 ft in radius, or ten 10-ft panels). Creatures in its path are pushed aside and make a DEX save: 10d6 Cold, half on a success. Each 10-ft section has AC 12 and 30 HP; a broken section leaves frigid air (CON save, 5d6 Cold, for a creature moving through it).</p>",
